## Tech Stack Justification

| Component | Technology | Justification |
|-----------|------------|----------------|
| **LLM** | Azure OpenAI GPT-4o | Enterprise-grade, tool-calling support, SDS/TDS domain knowledge |
| **Embeddings** | text-embedding-3-large | High-dimensional (3072) for fine-grained chemistry semantic matching |
| **Vector Search** | Azure AI Search | Native HNSW, metadata filtering, per-user isolation |
| **Blob Storage** | Azure Blob Storage | Durable, scalable raw PDF storage |
| **UI** | Streamlit | Rapid prototyping, tab-based navigation, session state management |
| **Graph** | LangGraph | State-driven agentic loops with built-in conditional edges |
| **PDF** | pypdf | Pure Python, no external dependencies |
| **Tokenization** | tiktoken | Accurate token counting for context window management |

